                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/15.0.0"&gt;v15.0.0 Prevent Breaking Changes in .NET 11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;.NET 11 Compatibility&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release provides compatibility with the upcoming release of .NET 11.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In .NET 11, &lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/maui/pull/34070" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/maui/pull/34070/hovercard"&gt;&lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui&lt;/code&gt; will no longer have access to internal .NET MAUI APIs&lt;/a&gt;. This release removes our use of internal .NET MAUI APIs to ensure compatibility with .NET 11.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-important"&gt;&lt;p class="markdown-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-report mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;Important&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We recommend every .NET MAUI app preparing for .NET 11 install this release, v15.0.0 (or later), before .NET 11 is released in November. Apps running &lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui&lt;/code&gt; v14.2.2 and earlier will not be compatible with .NET 11.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove MAUI internal API usage by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jfversluis/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jfversluis"&gt;@jfversluis&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4733992343" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3251" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3251/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3251"&gt;#3251&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardcode NuGet trusted publishing user by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jfversluis/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jfversluis"&gt;@jfversluis&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4905606477" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3266" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3266/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3266"&gt;#3266&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Housekeeping&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump actions/setup-dotnet from 5.4.0 to 6.0.0 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot"&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4926180668" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3268" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3268/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3268"&gt;#3268&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump actions/setup-java from 5.5.0 to 5.6.0 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="organization" data-hovercard-url="/orgs/dependabot/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dependabot"&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot] in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4926180112" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3267" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3267/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3267"&gt;#3267&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
